    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of this game is for the player to survive as long as possible in this virus-spreading world. Starting the round by clicking the &quot;Next Round&quot; button or using space key. Within a short time, you need to decide where to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/0d07d1aeaccdc4f0b686315c50e7848b.webp?t=1742458734\" width=30 height=30 /></span>\u00a0is a virus that can infect others at the same place and similar to it, i.e. the same color or same number. Then infected ones will take 2 rounds to upgrade from infected to a virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/40ad967354df46d843dc67d065ed52b1.webp?t=1742458734\" width=30 height=30 /></span>\u00a0is the virus just in a different display mode, it will infect its similar ones who starts with 3 or ends with 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/0f67577c93c1743a69226dbdc271e8ec.webp?t=1742458734\" width=30 height=30 /></span>\u00a0is super virus upgraded from virus after game level 3. It can infect all kinds at the same place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/25ac831739556678f23fe135c97bd9c8.webp?t=1742458734\" width=57 height=30 /></span>\u00a0are 3 types of medicines with different strength that can cure infected ones in full. Everyone will be immunised from infection for the next round after being cured. The player can pick them up when passing by and will always be cured in priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/7b0afd64582c44ad70328d29158438fe.webp?t=1742458734\" width=55 height=30 /></span>\u00a0can cure everyone when it passes by. But it will only be available once in one game level when reaching high infection percentage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of this game is for the player to survive as long as possible in this virus-spreading world. Starting the round by clicking the &quot;Next Round&quot; button or using space key. Within a short time, you need to decide where to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/0d07d1aeaccdc4f0b686315c50e7848b.webp?t=1742458734\" width=30 height=30 /></span>\u00a0is a virus that can infect others at the same place and similar to it, i.e. the same color or same number. Then infected ones will take 2 rounds to upgrade from infected to a virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/40ad967354df46d843dc67d065ed52b1.webp?t=1742458734\" width=30 height=30 /></span>\u00a0is the virus just in a different display mode, it will infect its similar ones who starts with 3 or ends with 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/0f67577c93c1743a69226dbdc271e8ec.webp?t=1742458734\" width=30 height=30 /></span>\u00a0is super virus upgraded from virus after game level 3. It can infect all kinds at the same place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/25ac831739556678f23fe135c97bd9c8.webp?t=1742458734\" width=57 height=30 /></span>\u00a0are 3 types of medicines with different strength that can cure infected ones in full. Everyone will be immunised from infection for the next round after being cured. The player can pick them up when passing by and will always be cured in priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565150/extras/7b0afd64582c44ad70328d29158438fe.webp?t=1742458734\" width=55 height=30 /></span>\u00a0can cure everyone when it passes by. But it will only be available once in one game level when reaching high infection percentage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
